    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CATASTROPHE is a minimalistic survival experience in the heart of hell. Without weapons or allies, your only chance is to run, outsmart your enemies, and survive until time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Hellish Atmosphere - A stylized red and black world inspired by nightmarish visions and apocalyptic themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc3 Pure Survival Gameplay - No combat, just movement. Stay alive by dodging and running away from everything that chases you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 Monsters from the Abyss are dangerous creatures. Their thirst for death will challenge your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Don't die until time runs out - that's your only goal</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CATASTROPHE is a minimalistic survival experience in the heart of hell. Without weapons or allies, your only chance is to run, outsmart your enemies, and survive until time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Hellish Atmosphere - A stylized red and black world inspired by nightmarish visions and apocalyptic themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc3 Pure Survival Gameplay - No combat, just movement. Stay alive by dodging and running away from everything that chases you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 Monsters from the Abyss are dangerous creatures. Their thirst for death will challenge your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f Don't die until time runs out - that's your only goal</p>",
    "short_description": "CATASTROPHE is a minimalist survival experience set in the heart of hell. You wake up in a surreal arena where the monsters of hell are already hunting you down. Without weapons or allies, your only chance is to escape, outwit your enemies, and survive until time runs out.",
